{"id":"c289f1c721012496","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md","title":"标准算术真理不可由算术公式定义","display":"thm-Tarski-undefinability — 标准算术真理不可由算术公式定义","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","aliases":["91-thm-Tarski-undefinability"],"display":"thm-Tarski-undefinability — 标准算术真理不可由算术公式定义","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-Tarski-undefinability — 标准算术真理不可由算术公式定义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> (能编码句法并支持对角化的算术语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> (标准自然数模型)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x),\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x),\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (一元公式与句子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (标准模型中的真算术句编码集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N})\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 中定义该集合)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}Tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}Tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等价地，不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 使所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>\n都满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\n\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N\\models\n\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若有这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>，对角化得到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span>；\n定义充分性又把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 等同，故标准模型中出现矛盾。</p>\n<p>语义版本不依赖“PA 能否证明所有双条件”。句法版本则需指定一个一致、\n足够强且能证明对角式的理论。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> 层级的部分\n真理仍可算术定义；不可定义的是全部算术真理的统一集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x),\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}Tarski\\text{-}undefinability}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models\n\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n","display":false}],"bytes":1725,"backlinks":[{"id":"850f86d5448feae4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Tarski不可定义性定理（见[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]）：\n对足够表达算术句法的标准算术语言，"},{"id":"54f6107246f40c19","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f343038d47627223","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6b23223b4dd97161","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6a4ad5688aac17fe","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e9c2daf67c9f2e7b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[